01:27:00,806 --> 01:27:03,594
-no, you weren't out long. -that is right.
- 不，你没有太久。 - 是对的。
bù nǐ méi yǒu tài jiǔ shì duì de

964
01:27:06,756 --> 01:27:08,169
One point...
一分...
yī fēn

965
01:27:09,657 --> 01:27:11,815
I don't know.
我不知道。
wǒ bù zhī dào

966
01:27:13,526 --> 01:27:17,728
There was a moment I thought it might be longer.
有一刻，我认为可能会更长。
yǒu yī kè wǒ rèn wéi kě néng huì gèng zhǎng

967
01:27:18,510 --> 01:27:21,783
But I changed my mind.
但是我改变了主意。
dàn shì wǒ gǎi biàn le zhǔ yì

968
01:27:28,776 --> 01:27:30,115
What is it, honey?
这是什么，亲爱的？
zhè shì shén me qīn ài de

969
01:27:30,486 --> 01:27:33,647
Mommy, I love you.
妈妈，我爱你。
mā mā wǒ ài nǐ

970
01:27:34,689 --> 01:27:37,033
I love you, too baby.
我也爱你，宝贝。
wǒ yě ài nǐ bǎo bèi

971
01:27:46,480 --> 01:27:48,563
What's wrong?
怎么了？
zěn me le

972
01:27:51,986 --> 01:27:53,101
What?
什么？
shén me

973
01:28:00,800 --> 01:28:02,735
Don't worry honey everything is fine.
不用担心亲爱的一切都很好。
bù yòng dān xīn qīn ài de yī qiè dōu hěn hǎo

974
01:28:03,590 --> 01:28:05,637
We're gonna have a wonderful party.
我们将举行一个很棒的聚会。
wǒ men jiāng jǔ xíng yí gè hěn bàng de jù huì

975
01:28:07,199 --> 01:28:09,244
We will make daddy such a nice cake.
我们将使爸爸成为一个很好的蛋糕。
wǒ men jiāng shǐ bà bà chéng wéi yí gè hěn hǎo de dàn gāo

976
01:28:15,455 --> 01:28:17,242
I love you sweetheart.
我爱你亲爱的。
wǒ ài nǐ qīn ài de

977
01:28:18,989 --> 01:28:20,849
You are my guy.
你是我的家伙。
nǐ shì wǒ de jiā huo

978
01:28:57,673 --> 01:29:02,247
Mommy. Mommy.
妈妈。妈妈。
mā mā mā mā

979
01:29:58,300 --> 01:29:59,789
Richard it's me.
理查德是我。
lǐ chá dé shì wǒ

980
01:29:59,938 --> 01:30:01,165
I'm early.
我很早。
wǒ hěn zǎo

981
01:30:06,632 --> 01:30:08,827
What the hell is going on?
到底是怎么回事？
dào dǐ shì zěn me huí shì

982
01:30:08,976 --> 01:30:10,426
Richard.
理查德。
lǐ chá dé

983
01:30:13,366 --> 01:30:14,407
What are you doing here?
你在这里做什么？
nǐ zài zhè lǐ zuò shén me

984
01:30:14,407 --> 01:30:15,374
You are early.
你还早。
nǐ hái zǎo

985
01:30:16,192 --> 01:30:18,015
What is going on here?
这里发生了什么？
zhè lǐ fā shēng le shén me

986
01:30:18,238 --> 01:30:20,656
-what are you doing? I had this wonderful idea...
-你在干什么？我有这个很棒的主意...
nǐ zài gàn shén me wǒ yǒu zhè gè hěn bàng de zhǔ yì

987
01:30:21,622 --> 01:30:22,812
I needed some light.
我需要一些灯。
wǒ xū yào yī xiē dēng

988
01:30:22,998 --> 01:30:24,486
I needed to let in some light.
我需要让一定程度地放心。
wǒ xū yào ràng yí dìng chéng dù dì fàng xīn

989
01:30:24,561 --> 01:30:26,718
Richard, What are you doing?
理查德，你在做什么？
lǐ chá dé nǐ zài zuò shén me

990
01:30:26,830 --> 01:30:28,579
I had this fantastic notion.
我有这个奇妙的想法。
wǒ yǒu zhè gè qí miào de xiǎng fǎ

991
01:30:29,508 --> 01:30:31,479
I took this insanity and riddled it together...
我采取了这种精神错乱，把它弄乱了...
wǒ cǎi qǔ le zhè zhǒng jīng shén cuò luàn bǎ tā nòng luàn le

992
01:30:31,666 --> 01:30:32,780
and it'd never occurred to me.
我从来没有想过。
wǒ cóng lái méi yǒu xiǎng guò

993
01:30:32,967 --> 01:30:34,343
Richard...
理查德...
lǐ chá dé

994
01:30:34,603 --> 01:30:35,681
Don't come near me.
不要靠近我。
bú yào kào jìn wǒ

995
01:30:41,486 --> 01:30:45,056
I seemed to me I needed to let in some light.
在我看来，我需要让一定程度地放心。
zài wǒ kàn lái wǒ xū yào ràng yí dìng chéng dù dì fàng xīn

996
01:30:48,440 --> 01:30:49,519
What do you think?
你怎么认为？
nǐ zěn me rèn wéi

997
01:30:49,593 --> 01:30:51,119
I cleared away all the windows.
我清理了所有窗户。
wǒ qīng lǐ le suǒ yǒu chuāng hù

998
01:30:51,416 --> 01:30:54,206
All right Richard, do me one simple favor...
好吧，理查德，请给我一个简单的忙...
hǎo ba lǐ chá dé qǐng gěi wǒ yí gè jiǎn dān de máng

999
01:30:54,541 --> 01:30:55,768
come, come sit.
来，来坐。
lái lái zuò

1000
01:30:56,438 --> 01:30:58,371
I don't think I can make it to the party.
我认为我不能参加聚会。
wǒ rèn wéi wǒ bù néng cān jiā jù huì

1001
01:30:58,483 --> 01:30:59,598
you don't have to go to the party.
您不必参加聚会。
nín bù bì cān jiā jù huì

1002
01:30:59,711 --> 01:31:01,087
you don't have to go to the ceremony...
您不必参加仪式...
nín bù bì cān jiā yí shì

1003
01:31:01,310 --> 01:31:01,941
you don't have to do anything you don't wanna do.
您不必做任何不想做的事情。
nín bù bì zuò rèn hé bù xiǎng zuò de shì qíng

1004
01:31:02,946 --> 01:31:04,843
You can do as you like.
您可以按照自己的意愿做。
nín kě yǐ àn zhào zì jǐ de yì yuàn zuò

1005
01:31:05,179 --> 01:31:06,629
But I still have to face the hours don't I...
但是我仍然必须面对几个小时，不是...
dàn shì wǒ réng rán bì xū miàn duì jǐ gè xiǎo shí bú shì

1006
01:31:07,634 --> 01:31:09,456
I mean the hours after the party
我的意思是聚会后的几个小时
wǒ de yì sī shì jù huì hòu de jǐ gè xiǎo shí

1007
01:31:09,828 --> 01:31:11,761
and the hours after that.
和之后的几个小时。
hé zhī hòu de jǐ gè xiǎo shí

1008
01:31:13,212 --> 01:31:15,555
You do have good days still
你仍然有美好的日子
nǐ réng rán yǒu měi hǎo de rì zi

1009
01:31:15,555 --> 01:31:16,857
you know you do.
你知道你愿意。
nǐ zhī dào nǐ yuàn yì

1010
01:31:17,043 --> 01:31:18,494
Not really.
并不真地。
bìng bù zhēn dì

1011
01:31:18,792 --> 01:31:20,801
Just kind of you to say so but...
只是你这么说，但是...
zhǐ shì nǐ zhè me shuō dàn shì

1012
01:31:20,987 --> 01:31:23,702
it is not really true.
这不是真的。
zhè bú shì zhēn de

1013
01:31:32,592 --> 01:31:33,894
Are they here?
他们在这里吗？
tā men zài zhè lǐ ma

1014
01:31:34,079 --> 01:31:34,897
Who?
WHO？

1015
01:31:35,008 --> 01:31:36,608
The voices.
声音。
shēng yīn

1016
01:31:37,055 --> 01:31:39,174
Oh, if, the voices are always here.
哦，如果，声音总是在这里。
ó rú guǒ shēng yīn zǒng shì zài zhè lǐ

1017
01:31:40,365 --> 01:31:42,708
And it's the voices you're hearing now, 'sn't it?
这是您现在听到的声音，不是吗？
zhè shì nín xiàn zài tīng dào de shēng yīn bú shì ma

1018
01:31:42,819 --> 01:31:44,755
No, no, no, no...
不，不，不，不...
bù bù bù bù

1019
01:31:45,089 --> 01:31:47,209
Mrs. Dalloway, it is you.
达洛威夫人，是你。
dá luò wēi fū rén shì nǐ

1020
01:31:52,453 --> 01:31:54,090
I'm still alive for you...
我还活着为你...
wǒ hái huó zhe wèi nǐ

1021
01:31:55,913 --> 01:31:58,405
but now you have to let me go.
但是现在你必须让我走。
dàn shì xiàn zài nǐ bì xū ràng wǒ zǒu

1022
01:32:00,152 --> 01:32:00,822
Richard ...I...
理查德...我...
lǐ chá dé wǒ

1023
01:32:00,934 --> 01:32:02,236
No, wait, wait.
不，等等，等等。
bù děng děng děng děng

1024
01:32:08,075 --> 01:32:09,452
Tell me the story.
告诉我这个故事。
gào sù wǒ zhè gè gù shì

1025
01:32:09,824 --> 01:32:10,903
What about?
那呢？
nà ne

1026
01:32:11,163 --> 01:32:13,692
Tell me story from your day
告诉我你那天的故事
gào sù wǒ nǐ nà tiān de gù shì

1027
01:32:14,659 --> 01:32:18,416
I... I got up...
我...我起床...
wǒ wǒ qǐ chuáng

1028
01:32:18,416 --> 01:32:19,197
Yes?
是的？
shì de

1029
01:32:19,458 --> 01:32:22,359
And...I went out and...
而且...我出去...
ér qiě wǒ chū qù

1030
01:32:22,508 --> 01:32:26,005
I went to buy flowers...
我去买花...
wǒ qù mǎi huā

1031
01:32:26,189 --> 01:32:28,050
like Mrs. Dalloway, in the book,you know?
像达洛威夫人一样，在书中，你知道吗？
xiàng dá luò wēi fū rén yī yàng zài shū zhōng nǐ zhī dào ma

1032
01:32:28,348 --> 01:32:29,165
Yes.
是的。
shì de

1033
01:32:29,462 --> 01:32:30,839
And it was a beautiful morning...
那是一个美丽的早晨...
nà shì yí gè měi lì de zǎo chén

1034
01:32:31,062 --> 01:32:32,029
Was it?
是吗？
shì ma

1035
01:32:32,253 --> 01:32:34,038
Yes, it was so beautiful...
是的，真漂亮...
shì de zhēn piào liàng

1036
01:32:34,335 --> 01:32:35,898
it was so fresh.
太新鲜了。
tài xīn xiān le

1037
01:32:36,083 --> 01:32:37,684
Oh, fresh, was it??
哦，新鲜，是吗？
ó xīn xiān shì ma

1038
01:32:37,906 --> 01:32:38,874
If.
如果。
rú guǒ

1039
01:32:42,333 --> 01:32:45,754
As... how that tomorrow in the beach?
AS ...明天在海滩上怎么样？
míng tiān zài hǎi tān shàng zěn me yàng

1040
01:32:46,758 --> 01:32:47,465
Oh, if.
哦，如果。
ó rú guǒ

1041
01:32:47,614 --> 01:32:48,841
How this?
这怎么了？
zhè zěn me le

1042
01:32:49,326 --> 01:32:50,255
Yes.
是的。
shì de

1043
01:32:50,441 --> 01:32:51,521
Like the morning on the beach...
就像在海滩上的早晨...
jiù xiàng zài hǎi tān shàng de zǎo chén

1044
01:32:51,744 --> 01:32:54,942
like that morning when you walked out of that house and... you were eighteen...
就像那天早上你走出那所房子，...你十八岁...
jiù xiàng nà tiān zǎo shàng nǐ zǒu chū nà suǒ fáng zi nǐ shí bā suì

1045
01:32:55,686 --> 01:32:57,620
may be I was nineteen.
可能是我十九岁。
kě néng shì wǒ shí jiǔ suì

1046
01:32:58,141 --> 01:32:59,591
Yes.
是的。
shì de

1047
01:33:00,335 --> 01:33:04,167
I was nineteen years old...
我十九岁...
wǒ shí jiǔ suì

1048
01:33:04,167 --> 01:33:08,517
and I had never seen anything so beautiful.
而且我从未见过如此美丽的东西。
ér qiě wǒ cóng wèi jiàn guò rú cǐ měi lì de dōng xī

1049
01:33:08,517 --> 01:33:13,353
You, coming out of the glass door early in the morning, still sleepy.
您，清晨从玻璃门出来，仍然困了。
nín qīng chén cóng bō lí mén chū lái réng rán kùn le

1050
01:33:15,363 --> 01:33:17,371
Isn't it strange?
这不是奇怪吗？
zhè bú shì qí guài ma

1051
01:33:18,300 --> 01:33:23,321
Most of an ordinary morning in anybody's life.
任何人一生中的大部分时间早晨。
rèn hé rén yī shēng zhōng de dà bù fèn shí jiān zǎo chén

1052
01:33:24,103 --> 01:33:27,079
I'm afraid I cannot make it to the party Clarissa.
恐怕我无法参加派对克拉丽莎（Clarissa）。
kǒng pà wǒ wú fǎ cān jiā pài duì kè lā lì shā

1053
01:33:28,976 --> 01:33:30,650
The party...
聚会...
jù huì

1054
01:33:30,910 --> 01:33:33,514
doesn't matter.
没关系。
méi guān xì

1055
01:33:34,741 --> 01:33:36,713
You have been so good to me, Mrs. Dalloway.
达洛威夫人，你对我真好。
dá luò wēi fū rén nǐ duì wǒ zhēn hǎo

1056
01:33:39,167 --> 01:33:40,469
I love you.
我爱你。
wǒ ài nǐ

1057
01:33:46,681 --> 01:33:50,772
I don't think that 2 people could have been happier than we have been.
我认为2个人本来可以比以前更快乐。
wǒ rèn wéi gè rén běn lái kě yǐ bǐ yǐ qián gèng kuài lè

1058
01:34:07,882 --> 01:34:08,999
Happy Birthday.
生日快乐。
shēng rì kuài lè

1059
01:34:09,928 --> 01:34:11,378
Happy Birthday honey.
生日快乐亲爱的。
shēng rì kuài lè qīn ài de

1060
01:34:11,899 --> 01:34:13,907
This is perfect, this is just perfect.
这是完美的，这是完美的。
zhè shì wán měi de zhè shì wán měi de

1061
01:34:14,614 --> 01:34:17,105
Do you really think so?
你真的这么认为吗？
nǐ zhēn de zhè me rèn wéi ma

1062
01:34:19,115 --> 01:34:20,342
Sure.
当然。
dāng rán

1063
01:34:20,826 --> 01:34:22,686
You must have been working all day.
您一定整天都在工作。
nín yí dìng zhěng tiān dōu zài gōng zuò

1064
01:34:22,835 --> 01:34:24,843
That's what I've been doing. working all day.
那就是我一直在做的。整天工作。
nà jiù shì wǒ yì zhí zài zuò de zhěng tiān gōng zuò

1065
01:34:25,438 --> 01:34:27,111
This is just fantastic.
这真是太棒了。
zhè zhēn shì tài bàng le

1066
01:34:28,413 --> 01:34:29,827
It is what I always wanted.
这是我一直想要的。
zhè shì wǒ yì zhí xiǎng yào de

1067
01:34:31,984 --> 01:34:34,328
Oneday Richie, I will tell you...
OneDay Richie，我会告诉你...
wǒ huì gào sù nǐ

1068
01:34:34,663 --> 01:34:36,337
I will tell you how it all that happened.
我会告诉你这一切发生了。
wǒ huì gào sù nǐ zhè yī qiè fā shēng le

1069
01:34:36,337 --> 01:34:37,452
Don't.
不。
bù

1070
01:34:37,601 --> 01:34:38,754
I want to.
我想要。
wǒ xiǎng yào

1071
01:34:39,238 --> 01:34:40,465
I want to tell him the story.
我想告诉他这个故事。
wǒ xiǎng gào sù tā zhè gè gù shì

1072
01:34:40,837 --> 01:34:45,003
What happened? When I was in the war...
发生了什么？当我在战争中...
fā shēng le shén me dāng wǒ zài zhàn zhēng zhōng

1073
01:34:45,152 --> 01:34:48,165
a war I found myself.
我发现自己的战争。
wǒ fā xiàn zì jǐ de zhàn zhēng

1074
01:34:48,239 --> 01:34:50,694
thinking about this girl that I had seen.I never met her
想着我见过的这个女孩。我从未见过她
xiǎng zhe wǒ jiàn guò de zhè gè nǚ hái wǒ cóng wèi jiàn guò tā

1075
01:34:50,843 --> 01:34:52,368
at high school.
在高中。
zài gāo zhōng

1076
01:34:53,260 --> 01:34:55,864
strange, fragile looking girl...
奇怪，脆弱的女孩...
qí guài cuì ruò de nǚ hái

1077
01:34:56,385 --> 01:35:01,333
named Laura MacGraw.
名为劳拉·麦格劳（Laura MacGraw）。
míng wèi láo lā mài gé láo

1078
01:35:02,224 --> 01:35:03,712
And She was shy...
她很害羞...
tā hěn hài xiū

1079
01:35:04,270 --> 01:35:06,241
and she was interesting.
她很有趣。
tā hěn yǒu qù

1080
01:35:06,985 --> 01:35:10,072
Now, your mother won't mind if I tell you this, Richie...
现在，你妈妈不介意我告诉你这个，里奇...
xiàn zài nǐ mā mā bù jiè yì wǒ gào sù nǐ zhè gè lǐ qí

1081
01:35:10,072 --> 01:35:11,300
she was the sort of the girl that you see...
她是你看到的那种女孩...
tā shì nǐ kàn dào de nà zhǒng nǚ hái

1082
01:35:11,486 --> 01:35:14,387
sitting mostly on her own. And I tell you...
主要坐着自己。我告诉你...
zhǔ yào zuò zhe zì jǐ wǒ gào sù nǐ

1083
01:35:14,648 --> 01:35:15,169
sometimes...
有时...
yǒu shí

1084
01:35:15,428 --> 01:35:18,181
when I was in the south pacific...
当我在南太平洋时...
dāng wǒ zài nán tài píng yáng shí

1085
01:35:18,330 --> 01:35:21,974
the fact is that I used to think about this girl.
事实是我曾经想过这个女孩。
shì shí shì wǒ céng jīng xiǎng guò zhè gè nǚ hái

1086
01:35:22,086 --> 01:35:23,277
Dan.
和。
hé

1087
01:35:24,207 --> 01:35:27,704
I used to think about bringing her to a house...
我曾经考虑过把她带到房子...
wǒ céng jīng kǎo lǜ guò bǎ tā dài dào fáng zi

1088
01:35:27,853 --> 01:35:29,265
to a life...
生活...
shēng huó

1089
01:35:30,307 --> 01:35:32,203
pretty much like this.
几乎这样。
jī hū zhè yàng

1090
01:35:34,213 --> 01:35:37,560
And what's the thought of the happiness...
那对幸福有什么想法...
nà duì xìng fú yǒu shén me xiǎng fǎ

1091
01:35:38,416 --> 01:35:41,280
the thought of this woman...
这个女人的想法...
zhè gè nǚ rén de xiǎng fǎ

1092
01:35:41,502 --> 01:35:42,767
the thought of this life...
这一生的想法...
