1122
01:38:18,578 --> 01:38:19,546
I was going to.
我要去。
wǒ yào qù

1123
01:38:19,733 --> 01:38:21,331
I was going to stop-by.
我要停下来。
wǒ yào tíng xià lái

1124
01:38:22,708 --> 01:38:24,232
I had a wonderful day...
我度过了美好的一天...
