1130
01:39:12,995 --> 01:39:14,149
What?
什么？
shén me

1131
01:39:17,645 --> 01:39:19,468
I thought you were going to bed.
我以为你要上床睡觉。
wǒ yǐ wéi nǐ yào shàng chuáng shuì jiào

1132
