I am...
我是...
wǒ shì

1133
01:39:22,481 --> 01:39:23,819
I am going to bed.
我要上床睡觉。
wǒ yào shàng chuáng shuì jiào

1134
01:39:26,571 --> 01:39:31,519
what then?
那呢？
nà ne

1135
01:39:31,519 --> 01:39:32,523
My mind isn't clear.
我的脑海不清楚。
wǒ de nǎo hǎi bù qīng chǔ

1136
01:39:33,602 --> 01:39:38,660
The story has returned to not to have direction...
这个故事回到了没有方向...
zhè gè gù shì huí dào le méi yǒu fāng xiàng

1137
01:39:38,660 --> 01:39:40,520
Mrs. Dalloway's destiny must be resolved.
达洛威夫人的命运必须得到解决。
