1140
01:40:32,147 --> 01:40:33,114
Of course.
当然。
dāng rán

1141
01:40:35,531 --> 01:40:37,131
I am Clarissa Vaughan.
我是克拉丽莎·沃恩（Clarissa Vaughan）。
wǒ shì kè lā lì shā wò ēn

1142
01:40:38,024 --> 01:40:39,215
Please come in.
请进来。
qǐng jìn lái

1143
01:40:48,699 --> 01:40:51,154
My friend Sally is in the kitchen...
我的朋友Sally在厨房...
wǒ de péng yǒu zài chú fáng

1144
01:40:51,303 --> 01:40:52,345
with my daughter.
和我的女儿。
hé wǒ de nǚ ér

1145
01:40:56,065 --> 01:40:57,700
you were having a party.
你在聚会。
nǐ zài jù huì

1146
01:40:59,486 --> 01:41:01,160
We were going to have a party.
我们要参加聚会。
wǒ men yào cān jiā jù huì

1147
01:41:02,275 --> 01:41:04,321
I was lucky I got the last plane from Toronto.
我很幸运，我从多伦多得到了最后一架飞机。
wǒ hěn xìng yùn wǒ cóng duō lún duō dé dào le zuì hòu yī jià fēi jī

1148
01:41:06,405 --> 01:41:07,334
so...
所以...
suǒ yǐ

1149
01:41:07,669 --> 01:41:08,823
that's the monster.
那是怪物。
