1198
01:45:20,858 --> 01:45:22,643
"I regretted it."
“我后悔。”
wǒ hòu huǐ

1199
01:45:24,280 --> 01:45:29,302
It would be easy
这很容易
zhè hěn róng yì

1200
01:45:30,788 --> 01:45:32,463
what would it mean...
这意味着什么...
zhè yì wèi zhe shén me

1201
01:45:33,950 --> 01:45:35,996
what is it mean to regret...
后悔意味着什么？
hòu huǐ yì wèi zhe shén me

1202
01:45:37,745 --> 01:45:40,237
when you have no choice
当你别无选择
dāng nǐ bié wú xuǎn zé

1203
01:45:51,024 --> 01:45:53,069
it is what you can bear.
这就是您可以承受的。
zhè jiù shì nín kě yǐ chéng shòu de

1204
01:45:58,835 --> 01:46:02,963
there it is. Noone's going to forgive me.
在那里。没有人会原谅我。
zài nà lǐ méi yǒu rén huì yuán liàng wǒ

1205
01:46:09,732 --> 01:46:11,666
It was death...
那是死亡...
nà shì sǐ wáng

1206
01:46:14,679 --> 01:46:19,664
and I chose life.
我选择了生活。
wǒ xuǎn zé le shēng huó

1207
01:47:17,019 --> 01:47:18,953
Take your coat off.
脱下外套。
tuō xià wài tào

1208
01:48:03,699 --> 01:48:08,720
I thought you would like a cup of tea.
我以为你想要一杯茶。
wǒ yǐ wéi nǐ xiǎng yào yī bēi chá

1209
01:48:08,720 --> 01:48:10,468
Oh my Goodness, thank you dear.
哦，天哪，谢谢亲爱的。
ó tiān nǎ xiè xiè qīn ài de

1210
01:48:10,468 --> 01:48:11,473
I feel like I'm stealing your room.
我觉得我在偷你的房间。
